This plugin packages the LLM Council skill published at
https://github.com/tenfoldmarc/llm-council-skill

That repository licenses the work under MIT in its README ("License — MIT —
do whatever you want with it"). GitHub's license detector does not surface it
because the terms are stated in the README rather than a LICENSE file, so the
grant is reproduced here in full to preserve the notice MIT requires.

The council methodology is Andrej Karpathy's
(https://github.com/karpathy/llm-council). The Claude Code sub-agent
adaptation is credited upstream to @olelehmann.

